## Latest research signals

```cmd
python scripts/generate_signals.py --data-dir data/raw/yfinance --instruments configs/instruments.yml --strategy configs/strategy.yml --out data/reports/latest_stock_signals_v5.csv --allow-missing
```

## Important interpretation

Do not judge the system only by the full-period backtest. A stronger result is one where:

- the strategy beats SPY and equal-weight over the full period,
- the walk-forward test remains positive,
- cost-stress results are still acceptable,
- no single sector dominates the latest signals,
- max drawdown remains inside your risk tolerance,
- the best config is not selected only because of one lucky period.

v5 is designed to improve robustness, participation, and validation. It cannot guarantee future profits.
